<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18057" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fēto</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foet-</span></b> ), āre, v. n. and
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a.</i> [2.
			fetus] (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>, <i>to bring forth</i>,
				<i>breed</i>, <i>hatch</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in quibus (paludibus) plerumque fetant
					(anates),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					8, 15, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silvestres gallinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					8, 8, 12</span></i>
			: cf. ib. § 8.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act.</i>, <i>to make fruitful</i>,
				<i>fructify</i>, <i>impregnate</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">feminas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. de Cons. Evang. 1, 25</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">armenta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. Civ. D. 5, 7 al.</span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
